## Conventions

- **Device component:** software that is part of the medical device and subject to IEC 62304.
- **Non-device component:** supporting tooling (config authoring app, monitoring, CI scripts) — not regulated as device software but must not compromise device safety.
- **Integration contracts:** each inter-component interface is defined as a versioned contract (OpenAPI / FHIR profile / JSON Schema / Protobuf). No informal coupling.

